        "title": "AA 相似定理 結構概念圖解",
        "caption": "直觀解析 AA 相似定理 之核心關係與成立條件",
        "svg": "<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 540 180\" class=\"kp-svg-infograph\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"AA 相似定理\">\n    <rect width=\"540\" height=\"180\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"#f4f8ee\" stroke=\"#668c36\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-opacity=\"0.25\"/>\n    <text x=\"24\" y=\"32\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#466421\">📐 數線與坐標對稱結構圖解</text>\n    <text x=\"516\" y=\"32\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#668c36\" font-weight=\"600\">📐 數理邏輯</text>\n    \n    <line x1=\"40\" y1=\"95\" x2=\"500\" y2=\"95\" stroke=\"#668c36\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/>\n    <polygon points=\"508,95 496,90 496,100\" fill=\"#668c36\"/>\n    <polygon points=\"32,95 44,90 44,100\" fill=\"#668c36\"/>\n    \n    <line x1=\"270\" y1=\"85\" x2=\"270\" y2=\"105\" stroke=\"#668c36\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n    <circle cx=\"270\" cy=\"95\" r=\"4\" fill=\"#466421\"/>\n    <text x=\"270\" y=\"125\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#283b12\">原點 0</text>\n    \n    <line x1=\"140\" y1=\"88\" x2=\"140\" y2=\"102\" stroke=\"#466421\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n    <circle cx=\"140\" cy=\"95\" r=\"6\" fill=\"#668c36\"/>\n    <rect x=\"75\" y=\"52\" width=\"130\" height=\"26\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#668c36\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/>\n    <text x=\"140\" y=\"69\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"11\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#283b12\">AA 相似定理: 兩組對應角相等即相似</text>\n    \n    <line x1=\"400\" y1=\"88\" x2=\"400\" y2=\"102\" stroke=\"#466421\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n    <circle cx=\"400\" cy=\"95\" r=\"6\" fill=\"#466421\"/>\n    <rect x=\"335\" y=\"52\" width=\"130\" height=\"26\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#466421\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/>\n    <text x=\"400\" y=\"69\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"11\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#466421\">對稱基準: 0</text>\n    \n    <path d=\"M 140 138 C 140 148, 270 148, 270 156 C 270 148, 400 148, 400 138\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#668c36\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-dasharray=\"4,2\"/>\n    <rect x=\"210\" y=\"148\" width=\"120\" height=\"22\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#668c36\"/>\n    <text x=\"270\" y=\"163\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"11\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#ffffff\">兩點對稱距離 |A−B|</text>\n  </svg>"
