        "svg": "<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 540 180\" class=\"kp-svg-infograph\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"詞的句式與押韻\">\n    <rect width=\"540\" height=\"180\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"#f1f3f9\" stroke=\"#5867a2\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-opacity=\"0.25\"/>\n    <text x=\"24\" y=\"30\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#3b4774\">🔄 推演機制與解題流程圖</text>\n    <text x=\"516\" y=\"30\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#5867a2\" font-weight=\"600\">✍️ 3-Stage</text>\n    \n    <g transform=\"translate(30, 52)\">\n      <rect width=\"135\" height=\"96\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#5867a2\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/>\n      <circle cx=\"20\" cy=\"20\" r=\"12\" fill=\"#5867a2\"/>\n      <text x=\"20\" y=\"24\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"11\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#ffffff\">1</text>\n      <text x=\"42\" y=\"24\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#212946\">審題定位</text>\n      <foreignObject x=\"10\" y=\"42\" width=\"115\" height=\"48\">\n        <div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\" style=\"font-size:11px;line-height:1.35;color:#334155;overflow:hidden;\">\n          先區分詞牌名稱與作品實際內容：同牌只提供形式上的共同線索。\n        </div>\n      </foreignObject>\n    </g>\n    \n    <path d=\"M 175 100 L 195 100\" stroke=\"#5867a2\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/>\n    <polygon points=\"199,100 191,96 191,104\" fill=\"#5867a2\"/>\n    \n    <g transform=\"translate(205, 52)\">\n      <rect width=\"135\" height=\"96\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#3b4774\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"/>\n      <circle cx=\"20\" cy=\"20\" r=\"12\" fill=\"#3b4774\"/>\n      <text x=\"20\" y=\"24\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"11\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#ffffff\">2</text>\n      <text x=\"42\" y=\"24\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#3b4774\">模型推演</text>\n      <foreignObject x=\"10\" y=\"42\" width=\"115\" height=\"48\">\n        <div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\" style=\"font-size:11px;line-height:1.35;color:#334155;overflow:hidden;\">\n          再找春遊作品的景物與行動、思鄉作品的地點與回憶，確認各自情境。\n        </div>\n      </foreignObject>\n    </g>\n    \n    <path d=\"M 350 100 L 370 100\" stroke=\"#3b4774\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/>\n    <polygon points=\"374,100 366,96 366,104\" fill=\"#3b4774\"/>\n    \n    <g transform=\"translate(380, 52)\">\n      <rect width=\"130\" height=\"96\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#5867a2\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"/>\n      <circle cx=\"20\" cy=\"20\" r=\"12\" fill=\"#5867a2\"/>\n      <text x=\"20\" y=\"24\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"11\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#ffffff\">3</text>\n      <text x=\"42\" y=\"24\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#212946\">驗算防呆</text>\n      <foreignObject x=\"10\" y=\"42\" width=\"110\" height=\"48\">\n        <div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\" style=\"font-size:11px;line-height:1.35;color:#334155;overflow:hidden;\">\n          比較語句節奏與轉折，說明相近形式如何承載不同情感。\n        </div>\n      </foreignObject>\n    </g>\n    \n    <text x=\"270\" y=\"166\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"11\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#5867a2\">🔗 閉環檢驗：確保每一步推理皆有課綱定義或物理/數學定理支撐</text>\n  </svg>"
