      "title": "【知識點 2】感嘆句結構：條件判別與推理步驟",
      "core": "感嘆句結構之判別準則：What + a/an + adj + 單數名詞 + S + V! / How + adj/adv + S + V!。",
      "explanation": "本知識點強調「感嘆句結構」的推演流程與判別條件。解題時切忌跳步，標準思考流程分為三階：首先定位題目給定之已知量與範圍；其次調用定理「What + a/an + adj + 單數名詞 + S + V! / How + adj/adv + S + V!」建立關聯式；最後代入實例檢核（例如：What a beautiful girl she is! / How fast he can run!）。What + a/an + adj + 單數名詞 + S + V! / How + adj/adv + S + V!。對應本課核心觀念：Adverbs of frequency (always, usually, often, sometimes, never) show how often an action happens. They come before action verbs but after be-verbs. The modal verb \"can\" expresses ability or permission and is followed by a base verb. \"There is\" and \"There are\" state existence.，唯有釐清適用邊界方能穩健破題。",
      "formula": "【推導公式／口訣】What + a/an + adj + 單數名詞 + S + V! / How + adj/adv + S + V! ➔ 典型示範：What a beautiful girl she is! / How fast he can run!",
      "practicalTip": "步驟防呆：第二句為 She can play chess.，can 已是情態助動詞，後面 play 不加 s，也不加 to。。",
