      "title": "【知識點 2】否定同等比較：條件判別與推理步驟",
      "core": "否定同等比較之判別準則：not as/so + 原級 + as（不及...；不如...）。",
      "explanation": "本知識點強調「否定同等比較」的推演流程與判別條件。解題時切忌跳步，標準思考流程分為三階：首先定位題目給定之已知量與範圍；其次調用定理「not as/so + 原級 + as（不及...；不如...）」建立關聯式；最後代入實例檢核（例如：This book is not as interesting as that movie. (That movie is more interesting.)）。not as/so + 原級 + as（不及...；不如...）。對應本課核心觀念：Linking verbs (look, sound, smell, taste, feel) describe sensory perception and are followed by adjectives, or \"like\" + nouns. Sensory verbs (see, hear, watch, notice) take an object followed by a base verb (entire action) or V-ing (action in progress). Superlatives compare three or more items using the + -est/most.，唯有釐清適用邊界方能穩健破題。",
      "formula": "【推導公式／口訣】not as/so + 原級 + as（不及...；不如...） ➔ 典型示範：This book is not as interesting as that movie. (That movie is more interesting.)",
      "practicalTip": "步驟防呆：感官句可寫 I saw Ken cross the street.，看見過街事件；或 saw Ken crossing，著眼正在過街的過程，不能接 crossed 當第二個限定動詞。。",
