      "title": "【知識點 2】授予動詞介系詞：條件判別與推理步驟",
      "core": "授予動詞介系詞之判別準則：give/send/show + 物 + to + 人；buy/make/cook + 物 + for + 人。",
      "explanation": "本知識點強調「授予動詞介系詞」的推演流程與判別條件。解題時切忌跳步，標準思考流程分為三階：首先定位題目給定之已知量與範圍；其次調用定理「give/send/show + 物 + to + 人；buy/make/cook + 物 + for + 人」建立關聯式；最後代入實例檢核（例如：He gave a gift to me. = He gave me a gift. / Mom bought a cake for us.）。give/send/show + 物 + to + 人；buy/make/cook + 物 + for + 人。對應本課核心觀念：Dative verbs take two objects: direct (thing) and indirect (person). When the person follows, prepositions are required: \"to\" for transfer (give, send, show), \"for\" for benefit/effort (buy, make, cook). Causative verbs (make, have, let) take an object and a bare infinitive (base verb). Present perfect with \"since\" indicates an action starting at a specific point in time.，唯有釐清適用邊界方能穩健破題。",
      "formula": "【推導公式／口訣】give/send/show + 物 + to + 人；buy/make/cook + 物 + for + 人 ➔ 典型示範：He gave a gift to me. = He gave me a gift. / Mom bought a cake for us.",
      "practicalTip": "步驟防呆：使役句為 He let me ride it.，let 後接 me 和原形 ride，不用 to ride。。",
      "bloom": "應用",
      "examWeight": 3,
