      "explanation": "會考與大考命題常藉由相近觀念或逆命題設置認知陷阱。針對「in」，必須明確區分「時間點」與「較長期間」兩者的本質分野。Do not say \"on 2024\" or \"in Sunday\". Remember you walk \"through\" a forest/tunnel (3D space), but walk \"across\" a street/bridge (flat surface).。正確策略是：遇題先確認是否滿足限制前提，並透過遷移任務（Write three sentences describing your morning commute to school, using at least three different prepositions of place and movement (e.g. out of, along, across, into).）自我檢視是否達成深層融會貫通。",
