      "title": "【知識點 1】可能發生：核心意義與原理機轉",
      "core": "可能發生之核心本質：If＋現在式，主句 will/can＋原形。",
      "explanation": "本知識點著眼於「可能發生」之本質定義。依據 108 課綱核心素養，If＋現在式，主句 will/can＋原形。對應本課核心觀念：Conditional adverb clauses introduced by \"if\" or \"unless\" describe conditions. In future conditional sentences (First Conditional), the condition clause uses the simple present tense to represent the future, while the main clause uses future tense with \"will/can/may\": \"If it rains tomorrow, we will cancel the picnic.\" \"Unless\" means \"if not\".。在實際解題與概念理解時，必須牢記其成立之關鍵準則：實戰檢核與適用條件：If it rains tomorrow, we will stay home.。避免僅死背名詞，而應從日常經驗（如：If you study hard every day, you will make great progress. / Unless you leave now, you will miss the morning train (= If you do not leave now...).）理解其物理、數學或邏輯必然性。",
      "formula": "【實戰法則】If＋現在式，主句 will/can＋原形 ➔ 檢驗條件：If it rains tomorrow, we will stay home.",
      "practicalTip": "大考辨識關鍵：當題幹出現「條件副詞子句與情態假設語氣、第一句描述明天可能發生的條件，if 子句填 rains，主句填 will stay。、可能發生、一般規律、與現在事實相反（延伸）」等關鍵條件或圖表特徵時立即啟動本課模型。。考場避坑：【高頻盲點】Do not put \"will\" inside the if-clause when expressing a future condition (say \"If tomorrow is sunny\", not \"If tomorrow will be sunny\").",
