      "explanation": "本知識點強調「一般規律」的推演流程與判別條件。解題時切忌跳步，標準思考流程分為三階：首先定位題目給定之已知量與範圍；其次調用定理「If＋現在式，主句現在式」建立關聯式；最後代入實例檢核（例如：If you heat ice enough, it melts.）。If＋現在式，主句現在式。對應本課核心觀念：Conditional adverb clauses introduced by \"if\" or \"unless\" describe conditions. In future conditional sentences (First Conditional), the condition clause uses the simple present tense to represent the future, while the main clause uses future tense with \"will/can/may\": \"If it rains tomorrow, we will cancel the picnic.\" \"Unless\" means \"if not\".，唯有釐清適用邊界方能穩健破題。",
