      "explanation": "本知識點著眼於「Skimming 略讀大意」之本質定義。依據 108 課綱核心素養，快速閱讀文章首尾段、每段首句與小標題，掌握核心主題與主旨。對應本課核心觀念：Literacy reading in CAP exams requires synthesizing multimodal texts: bus timetables, weather forecasts, product packaging, infographics, and email notices. Strategies include: skimming the title and layout for the communicative purpose, scanning for specific numbers/times/conditions, and identifying context clues (synonyms, antonyms, transition words like however/therefore) to solve cloze passages.。在實際解題與概念理解時，必須牢記其成立之關鍵準則：實戰檢核與適用條件：Read topic sentences first to capture the main idea before details.。避免僅死背名詞，而應從日常經驗（如：A flyer states: \"Adults $200; Students with ID $100; Free for children under 6.\" A family with two parents and a 5-year-old child pays $400.）理解其物理、數學或邏輯必然性。",
      "formula": "【實戰法則】快速閱讀文章首尾段、每段首句與小標題，掌握核心主題與主旨 ➔ 檢驗條件：Read topic sentences first to capture the main idea before details.",
