      "explanation": "本知識點強調「Scanning 掃讀細節」的推演流程與判別條件。解題時切忌跳步，標準思考流程分為三階：首先定位題目給定之已知量與範圍；其次調用定理「帶著關鍵字（數字、專有名詞、年代）在文章與圖表中定位具體資訊」建立關聯式；最後代入實例檢核（例如：Search for specific data, dates, or keywords without reading every word.）。帶著關鍵字（數字、專有名詞、年代）在文章與圖表中定位具體資訊。對應本課核心觀念：Literacy reading in CAP exams requires synthesizing multimodal texts: bus timetables, weather forecasts, product packaging, infographics, and email notices. Strategies include: skimming the title and layout for the communicative purpose, scanning for specific numbers/times/conditions, and identifying context clues (synonyms, antonyms, transition words like however/therefore) to solve cloze passages.，唯有釐清適用邊界方能穩健破題。",
      "formula": "【推導公式／口訣】帶著關鍵字（數字、專有名詞、年代）在文章與圖表中定位具體資訊 ➔ 典型示範：Search for specific data, dates, or keywords without reading every word.",
