        "svg": "<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 540 180\" class=\"kp-svg-infograph\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"韌皮部\">\n    <rect width=\"540\" height=\"180\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"#edf7f2\" stroke=\"#3f8768\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-opacity=\"0.25\"/>\n    <text x=\"24\" y=\"30\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#295d46\">⚖️ 易混淆概念雙軌辨析圖</text>\n    <text x=\"516\" y=\"30\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#3f8768\" font-weight=\"600\">🔬 Contrast</text>\n    \n    <rect x=\"30\" y=\"50\" width=\"220\" height=\"98\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#3f8768\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/>\n    <rect x=\"30\" y=\"50\" width=\"220\" height=\"26\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#3f8768\"/>\n    <text x=\"140\" y=\"67\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#ffffff\">① 木質部</text>\n    <foreignObject x=\"42\" y=\"82\" width=\"196\" height=\"58\">\n      <div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\" style=\"font-size:11px;line-height:1.35;color:#1e293b;overflow:hidden;\">\n        主要運輸水與無機鹽，常由根往上\n      </div>\n    </foreignObject>\n    \n    <circle cx=\"270\" cy=\"99\" r=\"18\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#295d46\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n    <text x=\"270\" y=\"104\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"900\" fill=\"#295d46\">VS</text>\n    \n    <rect x=\"290\" y=\"50\" width=\"220\" height=\"98\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#295d46\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/>\n    <rect x=\"290\" y=\"50\" width=\"220\" height=\"26\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#295d46\"/>\n    <text x=\"400\" y=\"67\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#ffffff\">② 韌皮部</text>\n    <foreignObject x=\"302\" y=\"82\" width=\"196\" height=\"58\">\n      <div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\" style=\"font-size:11px;line-height:1.35;color:#1e293b;overflow:hidden;\">\n        運輸有機養分，由供應部位通往需求部位\n      </div>\n    </foreignObject>\n    \n    <text x=\"270\" y=\"166\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"11\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#153628\">🛡️ 避坑分水嶺：抓住核心邊界條件，杜絕以假亂真或偷換概念</text>\n  </svg>"
