        "svg": "<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 540 180\" class=\"kp-svg-infograph\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"烴類（碳氫化合物）\">\n    <rect width=\"540\" height=\"180\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"#f6f1fb\" stroke=\"#8160a0\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-opacity=\"0.25\"/>\n    <text x=\"24\" y=\"30\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#5c3f78\">⚡ 核心法則與定量關係圖</text>\n    <text x=\"516\" y=\"30\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#8160a0\" font-weight=\"600\">🧪 烴類（碳氫化合物）</text>\n    \n    <rect x=\"30\" y=\"58\" width=\"135\" height=\"74\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#8160a0\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"/>\n    <rect x=\"30\" y=\"58\" width=\"135\" height=\"24\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#8160a0\"/>\n    <text x=\"97\" y=\"74\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"11\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#ffffff\">📥 輸入／已知條件</text>\n    <text x=\"97\" y=\"104\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#342147\">烴類（碳氫化合物）</text>\n    \n    <circle cx=\"190\" cy=\"95\" r=\"14\" fill=\"#f6f1fb\" stroke=\"#8160a0\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/>\n    <text x=\"190\" y=\"100\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"16\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#8160a0\">➔</text>\n    \n    <rect x=\"215\" y=\"58\" width=\"135\" height=\"74\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#5c3f78\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"/>\n    <rect x=\"215\" y=\"58\" width=\"135\" height=\"24\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#5c3f78\"/>\n    <text x=\"282\" y=\"74\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"11\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#ffffff\">⚙️ 轉換／運算機制</text>\n    <text x=\"282\" y=\"104\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#5c3f78\">僅由碳與氫組成；甲烷 (CH</text>\n    \n    <circle cx=\"375\" cy=\"95\" r=\"14\" fill=\"#f6f1fb\" stroke=\"#5c3f78\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/>\n    <text x=\"375\" y=\"100\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"16\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#5c3f78\">＝</text>\n    \n    <rect x=\"400\" y=\"52\" width=\"115\" height=\"86\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#8160a0\" stroke-width=\"2.2\"/>\n    <rect x=\"400\" y=\"52\" width=\"115\" height=\"24\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#8160a0\"/>\n    <text x=\"457\" y=\"68\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"11\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#ffffff\">🎯 判準結論</text>\n    <text x=\"457\" y=\"102\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"800\" fill=\"#342147\">天然氣主成分甲烷；液化石</text>\n    \n    <rect x=\"30\" y=\"146\" width=\"485\" height=\"22\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#8160a0\" fill-opacity=\"0.12\"/>\n    <text x=\"272\" y=\"161\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"11\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#342147\">💡 檢核要領：保留完整單位、驗證正負號與邊界限制</text>\n  </svg>"
