        "svg": "<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 540 180\" class=\"kp-svg-infograph\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"臺灣地質板塊配置\">\n    <rect width=\"540\" height=\"180\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"#f0f4fa\" stroke=\"#546e9f\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-opacity=\"0.25\"/>\n    <text x=\"24\" y=\"30\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#374b72\">🔄 推演機制與解題流程圖</text>\n    <text x=\"516\" y=\"30\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#546e9f\" font-weight=\"600\">🌍 3-Stage</text>\n    \n    <g transform=\"translate(30, 52)\">\n      <rect width=\"135\" height=\"96\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#546e9f\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/>\n      <circle cx=\"20\" cy=\"20\" r=\"12\" fill=\"#546e9f\"/>\n      <text x=\"20\" y=\"24\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"11\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#ffffff\">1</text>\n      <text x=\"42\" y=\"24\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#1e2b44\">審題定位</text>\n      <foreignObject x=\"10\" y=\"42\" width=\"115\" height=\"48\">\n        <div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\" style=\"font-size:11px;line-height:1.35;color:#334155;overflow:hidden;\">\n          抬升是地殼構造運動使地表提高，侵蝕則移走物質，兩者可同時發生。\n        </div>\n      </foreignObject>\n    </g>\n    \n    <path d=\"M 175 100 L 195 100\" stroke=\"#546e9f\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/>\n    <polygon points=\"199,100 191,96 191,104\" fill=\"#546e9f\"/>\n    \n    <g transform=\"translate(205, 52)\">\n      <rect width=\"135\" height=\"96\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#374b72\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"/>\n      <circle cx=\"20\" cy=\"20\" r=\"12\" fill=\"#374b72\"/>\n      <text x=\"20\" y=\"24\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"11\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#ffffff\">2</text>\n      <text x=\"42\" y=\"24\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#374b72\">模型推演</text>\n      <foreignObject x=\"10\" y=\"42\" width=\"115\" height=\"48\">\n        <div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\" style=\"font-size:11px;line-height:1.35;color:#334155;overflow:hidden;\">\n          若其他條件相近且抬升速率大於地表降低速率，高度可淨增加。\n        </div>\n      </foreignObject>\n    </g>\n    \n    <path d=\"M 350 100 L 370 100\" stroke=\"#374b72\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/>\n    <polygon points=\"374,100 366,96 366,104\" fill=\"#374b72\"/>\n    \n    <g transform=\"translate(380, 52)\">\n      <rect width=\"130\" height=\"96\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#546e9f\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"/>\n      <circle cx=\"20\" cy=\"20\" r=\"12\" fill=\"#546e9f\"/>\n      <text x=\"20\" y=\"24\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"11\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#ffffff\">3</text>\n      <text x=\"42\" y=\"24\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#1e2b44\">驗算防呆</text>\n      <foreignObject x=\"10\" y=\"42\" width=\"110\" height=\"48\">\n        <div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\" style=\"font-size:11px;line-height:1.35;color:#334155;overflow:hidden;\">\n          河流也可能持續下切，形成深谷，並非一有侵蝕就不能造山。\n        </div>\n      </foreignObject>\n    </g>\n    \n    <text x=\"270\" y=\"166\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"11\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#546e9f\">🔗 閉環檢驗：確保每一步推理皆有課綱定義或物理/數學定理支撐</text>\n  </svg>"
