        "svg": "<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 540 180\" class=\"kp-svg-infograph\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"凹透鏡光學特性\">\n    <rect width=\"540\" height=\"180\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"#edf5f7\" stroke=\"#487b8a\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-opacity=\"0.25\"/>\n    <text x=\"24\" y=\"30\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#305560\">🔄 推演機制與解題流程圖</text>\n    <text x=\"516\" y=\"30\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#487b8a\" font-weight=\"600\">⚡ 3-Stage</text>\n    \n    <g transform=\"translate(30, 52)\">\n      <rect width=\"135\" height=\"96\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#487b8a\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/>\n      <circle cx=\"20\" cy=\"20\" r=\"12\" fill=\"#487b8a\"/>\n      <text x=\"20\" y=\"24\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"11\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#ffffff\">1</text>\n      <text x=\"42\" y=\"24\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#1b3239\">審題定位</text>\n      <foreignObject x=\"10\" y=\"42\" width=\"115\" height=\"48\">\n        <div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\" style=\"font-size:11px;line-height:1.35;color:#334155;overflow:hidden;\">\n          30＞2f，所以像倒立、縮小、為實像，可在透鏡另一側承接。\n        </div>\n      </foreignObject>\n    </g>\n    \n    <path d=\"M 175 100 L 195 100\" stroke=\"#487b8a\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/>\n    <polygon points=\"199,100 191,96 191,104\" fill=\"#487b8a\"/>\n    \n    <g transform=\"translate(205, 52)\">\n      <rect width=\"135\" height=\"96\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#305560\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"/>\n      <circle cx=\"20\" cy=\"20\" r=\"12\" fill=\"#305560\"/>\n      <text x=\"20\" y=\"24\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"11\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#ffffff\">2</text>\n      <text x=\"42\" y=\"24\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#305560\">模型推演</text>\n      <foreignObject x=\"10\" y=\"42\" width=\"115\" height=\"48\">\n        <div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\" style=\"font-size:11px;line-height:1.35;color:#334155;overflow:hidden;\">\n          10＜15＜20，所以像倒立、放大、為實像。\n        </div>\n      </foreignObject>\n    </g>\n    \n    <path d=\"M 350 100 L 370 100\" stroke=\"#305560\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/>\n    <polygon points=\"374,100 366,96 366,104\" fill=\"#305560\"/>\n    \n    <g transform=\"translate(380, 52)\">\n      <rect width=\"130\" height=\"96\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#487b8a\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"/>\n      <circle cx=\"20\" cy=\"20\" r=\"12\" fill=\"#487b8a\"/>\n      <text x=\"20\" y=\"24\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"11\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#ffffff\">3</text>\n      <text x=\"42\" y=\"24\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#1b3239\">驗算防呆</text>\n      <foreignObject x=\"10\" y=\"42\" width=\"110\" height=\"48\">\n        <div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\" style=\"font-size:11px;line-height:1.35;color:#334155;overflow:hidden;\">\n          5＜f，所以像正立、放大、為虛像，觀察者透過鏡片看見但不能投影到屏上。\n        </div>\n      </foreignObject>\n    </g>\n    \n    <text x=\"270\" y=\"166\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"11\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#487b8a\">🔗 閉環檢驗：確保每一步推理皆有課綱定義或物理/數學定理支撐</text>\n  </svg>"
