        "svg": "<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 540 180\" class=\"kp-svg-infograph\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"引潮力物理成因\">\n    <rect width=\"540\" height=\"180\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"#f0f4fa\" stroke=\"#546e9f\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-opacity=\"0.25\"/>\n    <text x=\"24\" y=\"28\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#374b72\">🔄 封閉系統循環與動態流向圖</text>\n    <text x=\"516\" y=\"28\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#546e9f\" font-weight=\"600\">🌍 地球天文</text>\n    \n    <circle cx=\"270\" cy=\"98\" r=\"28\" fill=\"#546e9f\" fill-opacity=\"0.15\" stroke=\"#546e9f\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n    <text x=\"270\" y=\"94\" font-size=\"10\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#1e2b44\" text-anchor=\"middle\">系統守恆</text>\n    <text x=\"270\" y=\"108\" font-size=\"9\" fill=\"#374b72\" text-anchor=\"middle\">能量／物質</text>\n    \n    <rect x=\"210\" y=\"40\" width=\"120\" height=\"26\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#546e9f\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/>\n    <text x=\"270\" y=\"57\" font-size=\"11\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#1e2b44\" text-anchor=\"middle\">① 引潮力物理成因</text>\n    \n    <rect x=\"375\" y=\"86\" width=\"125\" height=\"26\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#374b72\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/>\n    <text x=\"437\" y=\"103\" font-size=\"11\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#374b72\" text-anchor=\"middle\">② 半日潮週期規律</text>\n    \n    <rect x=\"210\" y=\"128\" width=\"120\" height=\"26\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#546e9f\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/>\n    <text x=\"270\" y=\"145\" font-size=\"11\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#1e2b44\" text-anchor=\"middle\">③ 大潮（朔望大潮）</text>\n    \n    <rect x=\"40\" y=\"86\" width=\"125\" height=\"26\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#374b72\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/>\n    <text x=\"102\" y=\"103\" font-size=\"11\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#374b72\" text-anchor=\"middle\">④ 環境守恆</text>\n    \n    <path d=\"M 335 53 C 365 62, 385 70, 395 82\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#546e9f\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/>\n    <path d=\"M 437 114 C 430 130, 380 138, 335 140\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#374b72\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/>\n    <path d=\"M 205 140 C 165 138, 120 130, 110 114\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#546e9f\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/>\n    <path d=\"M 102 84 C 115 70, 155 60, 205 53\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#374b72\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/>\n    \n    <text x=\"270\" y=\"170\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"10.5\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#1e2b44\">💡 核心規律：各環節相互轉換且守恆，任一環節受阻將引發連鎖失衡</text>\n  </svg>"
