        "caption": "直觀解析 學生自治民主實踐 之核心關係與成立條件",
        "svg": "<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 540 180\" class=\"kp-svg-infograph\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"學生自治民主實踐\">\n    <rect width=\"540\" height=\"180\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"#fbf2ed\" stroke=\"#b07150\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-opacity=\"0.25\"/>\n    <text x=\"24\" y=\"30\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#7d4d34\">⚖️ 動態平衡與系統制衡模型</text>\n    <text x=\"516\" y=\"30\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#b07150\" font-weight=\"600\">⚖️ Equilibrium</text>\n    \n    <line x1=\"100\" y1=\"92\" x2=\"440\" y2=\"92\" stroke=\"#b07150\" stroke-width=\"4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/>\n    \n    <polygon points=\"270,92 250,135 290,135\" fill=\"#7d4d34\"/>\n    <rect x=\"210\" y=\"137\" width=\"120\" height=\"20\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#b07150\"/>\n    <text x=\"270\" y=\"151\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"11\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#ffffff\">制度基石</text>\n    \n    <rect x=\"70\" y=\"52\" width=\"120\" height=\"38\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#b07150\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/>\n    <text x=\"130\" y=\"75\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#4d2b1a\">學生自治民主實踐</text>\n    <line x1=\"130\" y1=\"90\" x2=\"130\" y2=\"92\" stroke=\"#b07150\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n    \n    <rect x=\"350\" y=\"52\" width=\"120\" height=\"38\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#7d4d34\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/>\n    <text x=\"410\" y=\"75\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#7d4d34\">相對權力/利益</text>\n    <line x1=\"410\" y1=\"90\" x2=\"410\" y2=\"92\" stroke=\"#7d4d34\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n    \n    <text x=\"270\" y=\"170\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"11\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#4d2b1a\">💡 核心啟發：依《教育基本法》與學校自治規章，</text>\n  </svg>"
