        "svg": "<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 540 180\" class=\"kp-svg-infograph\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"少年刑事案件要件\">\n    <rect width=\"540\" height=\"180\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"#fbf2ed\" stroke=\"#b07150\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-opacity=\"0.25\"/>\n    <text x=\"24\" y=\"30\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#7d4d34\">⚖️ 易混淆概念雙軌辨析圖</text>\n    <text x=\"516\" y=\"30\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#b07150\" font-weight=\"600\">⚖️ Contrast</text>\n    \n    <rect x=\"30\" y=\"50\" width=\"220\" height=\"98\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#b07150\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/>\n    <rect x=\"30\" y=\"50\" width=\"220\" height=\"26\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#b07150\"/>\n    <text x=\"140\" y=\"67\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#ffffff\">① 少年需求</text>\n    <foreignObject x=\"42\" y=\"82\" width=\"196\" height=\"58\">\n      <div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\" style=\"font-size:11px;line-height:1.35;color:#1e293b;overflow:hidden;\">\n        保護與教育重視發展及處境\n      </div>\n    </foreignObject>\n    \n    <circle cx=\"270\" cy=\"99\" r=\"18\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#7d4d34\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n    <text x=\"270\" y=\"104\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"900\" fill=\"#7d4d34\">VS</text>\n    \n    <rect x=\"290\" y=\"50\" width=\"220\" height=\"98\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#7d4d34\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/>\n    <rect x=\"290\" y=\"50\" width=\"220\" height=\"26\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#7d4d34\"/>\n    <text x=\"400\" y=\"67\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#ffffff\">② 權利責任</text>\n    <foreignObject x=\"302\" y=\"82\" width=\"196\" height=\"58\">\n      <div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\" style=\"font-size:11px;line-height:1.35;color:#1e293b;overflow:hidden;\">\n        保障權益不等於不需理解規範或承擔相應責任\n      </div>\n    </foreignObject>\n    \n    <text x=\"270\" y=\"166\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"11\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#4d2b1a\">🛡️ 避坑分水嶺：抓住核心邊界條件，杜絕以假亂真或偷換概念</text>\n  </svg>"
