        "caption": "精準辨析易混淆點，掌握解題分水嶺",
        "svg": "<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 540 180\" class=\"kp-svg-infograph\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"立場\">\n    <rect width=\"540\" height=\"180\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"#faf4ea\" stroke=\"#a97b36\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-opacity=\"0.25\"/>\n    <text x=\"24\" y=\"30\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#795521\">⚖️ 易混淆概念雙軌辨析圖</text>\n    <text x=\"516\" y=\"30\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#a97b36\" font-weight=\"600\">🏛️ Contrast</text>\n    \n    <rect x=\"30\" y=\"50\" width=\"220\" height=\"98\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#a97b36\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/>\n    <rect x=\"30\" y=\"50\" width=\"220\" height=\"26\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#a97b36\"/>\n    <text x=\"140\" y=\"67\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#ffffff\">① 政治建立</text>\n    <foreignObject x=\"42\" y=\"82\" width=\"196\" height=\"58\">\n      <div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\" style=\"font-size:11px;line-height:1.35;color:#1e293b;overflow:hidden;\">\n        政權宣布建立不代表所有地區立即穩定統一\n      </div>\n    </foreignObject>\n    \n    <circle cx=\"270\" cy=\"99\" r=\"18\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#795521\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n    <text x=\"270\" y=\"104\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"900\" fill=\"#795521\">VS</text>\n    \n    <rect x=\"290\" y=\"50\" width=\"220\" height=\"98\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#795521\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/>\n    <rect x=\"290\" y=\"50\" width=\"220\" height=\"26\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#795521\"/>\n    <text x=\"400\" y=\"67\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#ffffff\">② 實際治理</text>\n    <foreignObject x=\"302\" y=\"82\" width=\"196\" height=\"58\">\n      <div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\" style=\"font-size:11px;line-height:1.35;color:#1e293b;overflow:hidden;\">\n        中央地方關係、戰爭與社會改革仍持續變動\n      </div>\n    </foreignObject>\n    \n    <text x=\"270\" y=\"166\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"11\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#473010\">🛡️ 避坑分水嶺：抓住核心邊界條件，杜絕以假亂真或偷換概念</text>\n  </svg>"
