        "svg": "<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 540 180\" class=\"kp-svg-infograph\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"舞台形式多樣性\">\n    <rect width=\"540\" height=\"180\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"#faf1f4\" stroke=\"#a45e74\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-opacity=\"0.25\"/>\n    <text x=\"24\" y=\"30\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#753e4f\">🔄 推演機制與解題流程圖</text>\n    <text x=\"516\" y=\"30\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#a45e74\" font-weight=\"600\">🎭 3-Stage</text>\n    \n    <g transform=\"translate(30, 52)\">\n      <rect width=\"135\" height=\"96\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#a45e74\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/>\n      <circle cx=\"20\" cy=\"20\" r=\"12\" fill=\"#a45e74\"/>\n      <text x=\"20\" y=\"24\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"11\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#ffffff\">1</text>\n      <text x=\"42\" y=\"24\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#47212d\">審題定位</text>\n      <foreignObject x=\"10\" y=\"42\" width=\"115\" height=\"48\">\n        <div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\" style=\"font-size:11px;line-height:1.35;color:#334155;overflow:hidden;\">\n          記錄換景實際秒數與卡住的步驟，不只說「太慢」。\n        </div>\n      </foreignObject>\n    </g>\n    \n    <path d=\"M 175 100 L 195 100\" stroke=\"#a45e74\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/>\n    <polygon points=\"199,100 191,96 191,104\" fill=\"#a45e74\"/>\n    \n    <g transform=\"translate(205, 52)\">\n      <rect width=\"135\" height=\"96\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#753e4f\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"/>\n      <circle cx=\"20\" cy=\"20\" r=\"12\" fill=\"#753e4f\"/>\n      <text x=\"20\" y=\"24\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"11\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#ffffff\">2</text>\n      <text x=\"42\" y=\"24\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#753e4f\">模型推演</text>\n      <foreignObject x=\"10\" y=\"42\" width=\"115\" height=\"48\">\n        <div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\" style=\"font-size:11px;line-height:1.35;color:#334155;overflow:hidden;\">\n          檢查道具位置、移動路線與人員分工，改為固定順序並排除交叉碰撞。\n        </div>\n      </foreignObject>\n    </g>\n    \n    <path d=\"M 350 100 L 370 100\" stroke=\"#753e4f\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/>\n    <polygon points=\"374,100 366,96 366,104\" fill=\"#753e4f\"/>\n    \n    <g transform=\"translate(380, 52)\">\n      <rect width=\"130\" height=\"96\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#a45e74\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"/>\n      <circle cx=\"20\" cy=\"20\" r=\"12\" fill=\"#a45e74\"/>\n      <text x=\"20\" y=\"24\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"11\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#ffffff\">3</text>\n      <text x=\"42\" y=\"24\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#47212d\">驗算防呆</text>\n      <foreignObject x=\"10\" y=\"42\" width=\"110\" height=\"48\">\n        <div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\" style=\"font-size:11px;line-height:1.35;color:#334155;overflow:hidden;\">\n          重新計時並確認安全，再比較節奏是否改善。\n        </div>\n      </foreignObject>\n    </g>\n    \n    <text x=\"270\" y=\"166\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"11\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#a45e74\">🔗 閉環檢驗：確保每一步推理皆有課綱定義或物理/數學定理支撐</text>\n  </svg>"
